get.description:
Install-time security scan of a hub skill WITHOUT installing it (the CLI's
``scan_skill`` / ``should_allow_install`` pipeline on a quarantined bundle);
scoped to ``profile`` so the bundle resolves where an install would.

post.description:
Spawn ``hermes tools post-setup <key>`` (long-running installs) as a
background action tailed via ``GET /api/actions/tools-post-setup/status``;
``profile`` is threaded so hooks see the drawer's HERMES_HOME.
